    "created_at": "2023-06-07T21:40:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-06-07T21:40:49Z",
    "body": "Maybe \"skipAttributeCheck\" could be expanded to a \"ignoreDomState\" parameter which would also satisfy the need to hide the popover after it has been disconnected: https://github.com/whatwg/dom/pull/1185#issuecomment-1579186990\r\n\r\nInstead of modifying the check popover algorithm, we could just replace calls to the check popover algorithm with a simple check of whether or not the popover is in the showing state when the hide popover algorithm is called with the \"ignoreDomState\" option",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
